      "$value": "#6b6b6b",
      "$description": "Secondary text, labels and tool icons: 4.5:1 or better on panel, fill and frame (WCAG AA). Grey 3 (#7a7a7a) is 3.8:1 on fill, so it isn't used for text in interfaces."
